# In the Name of Science (otherAreas 76): the nosTrades table, the earrings:
# Sanative Earring, Relaxing Earring.
# Accepted, The Warriors' Path completed (current Emptiness Bleeds), a WAR 75. For each entry, from no target: the
# GMs give its base, a pie and its organs; its base traded: 526 (the base; the target set; the base taken); a script
# talk after the default 527: 532 or 528 with the base (the draw); the pie: 531 (pie, 0, the hint; taken); each organ
# one short: nothing (no target-0 base arm, no pie); the organs: 529 (Gorget, Silver Earring, Silver Obi); its finish:
# the entry's item, the target 0, completed (again after the first), the organs taken. Every reward is rare and
# different. Generated: tools/golden_in_the_name_of_science.py table earrings.
char zone=TavnazianSafehold pos=82.5,-25.0,3.5 job=WAR lvl=75
mission Cop EmptinessBleeds current
quest OtherAreas.InTheNameOfScience accepted
login
item SilverEarring                      # Sanative Earring (14791, hint 17): its base, a pie, its organs (GMs)
item WhiteChip
item ApplePie
item SampleOfLuminianTissue x5
item EuvhiOrgan x5
trade Yurim SilverEarring x1 WhiteChip x1  # no target: the Sanative Earring base: target 14791; 526
finish                                  # the base taken
trigger Yurim                           # the default 527
finish
trigger Yurim                           # a target: 532 or 528 (Silver Earring, White Chip)
finish
trade Yurim ApplePie x1                 # 531 (Apple Pie, 0, 17)
finish                                  # the pie taken
trade Yurim SampleOfLuminianTissue x4 EuvhiOrgan x5  # one Sample Of Luminian Tissue short: nothing
trade Yurim SampleOfLuminianTissue x5 EuvhiOrgan x4  # one Euvhi Organ short: nothing
trade Yurim SampleOfLuminianTissue x5 EuvhiOrgan x5  # the organs: 529
finish                                  # the Sanative Earring; the target 0; completed; the organs taken
item SilverEarring                      # Relaxing Earring (14792, hint 17): its base, a pie, its organs (GMs)
item BlackChip
item ApplePie
item SampleOfLuminianTissue x5
item EuvhiOrgan x5
trade Yurim SilverEarring x1 BlackChip x1  # no target: the Relaxing Earring base: target 14792; 526
finish                                  # the base taken
trigger Yurim                           # the default 527
finish
trigger Yurim                           # a target: 532 or 528 (Silver Earring, Black Chip)
finish
trade Yurim ApplePie x1                 # 531 (Apple Pie, 0, 17)
finish                                  # the pie taken
trade Yurim SampleOfLuminianTissue x4 EuvhiOrgan x5  # one Sample Of Luminian Tissue short: nothing
trade Yurim SampleOfLuminianTissue x5 EuvhiOrgan x4  # one Euvhi Organ short: nothing
trade Yurim SampleOfLuminianTissue x5 EuvhiOrgan x5  # the organs: 529
finish                                  # the Relaxing Earring; the target 0; completed; the organs taken
